B.bED=s(["Lyen retou pou reyinisyalizasyon an poko konfigire sou s\xe8v\xe8 a.","L\u2019URL de retour de r\xe9initialisation n\u2019est pas configur\xe9e sur le serveur.","The password-reset redirect URL is not configured on the server."],t.s)
B.br1=s(["Pa gen pwopriyet\xe8 aktif pou sal sa a.","Aucun propri\xe9taire actif pour cette salle.","This gym has no active owner."],t.s)
B.bpI=s(["Im\xe8l sa a deja gen yon kont. Chwazi yon l\xf2t im\xe8l; aplikasyon an pa transfere kont ant sal yo.","Cet email poss\xe8de d\xe9j\xe0 un compte. Choisissez un autre email ; l\u2019application ne transf\xe8re pas les comptes entre salles.","This email already has an account. Choose another email; accounts are not transferred between gyms."],t.s)
B.bt8=s(["K\xf2d sal sa a deja itilize.","Ce code de salle est d\xe9j\xe0 utilis\xe9.","This gym code is already in use."],t.s)
B.bAv=s(["\xd2f ou chwazi a pa disponib ank\xf2. Rechaje paj la epi chwazi yon l\xf2t.","L\u2019offre choisie n\u2019est plus disponible. Rechargez la page et choisissez-en une autre.","The selected offer is no longer available. Reload the page and pick another."],t.s)
B.bjh=s(["Kreyasyon an pa konfime. Kenbe menm demann lan epi eseye ank\xf2.","La cr\xe9ation n\u2019est pas confirm\xe9e. Conservez la m\xeame demande et r\xe9essayez.","Creation is not confirmed. Keep the same request and retry."],t.s)
